    "result_text": "The full test suite passes (267 tests, 0 failures). \n\nThe change is complete. I implemented the `displayName` feature as follows:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a read-only `displayName` string field to the `Owner` response schema (so the generated `OwnerDto` exposes it, while the writable `OwnerFields` input stays unchanged).\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added a MapStruct `@Mapping` expression on `toOwnerDto` that computes `displayName` as `lastName + \", \" + firstName`.\n\nBecause the display name is derived in the mapper, it appears consistently in every owner response \u2014 both the `POST /api/owners` create response and `GET /api/owners/{id}`. The new `Cp06Tests` acceptance test and all 267 existing tests pass.",
